  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Writing this up for a friend, but they've a rather unique binding setup where they had their left and right hand gestures bound to their right thumbstick. On the old system, their bindings worked fine, but on the new input system the gestures they bind to their right thumbstick will only perform right hand gestures and not left handed ones as well. It seems left or right handed gestures will only work with the corresponding controller performed on. It'd be nice if these gesture commands could be separated into left and right variants so as to be freely bound to where-ever necessary.\n\nAs seen in the image provided, the bindable gestures only come as is and will perform a right or left hand gesture depending on which controller it's bound to. Right and left variants would be nice to have.",
